Z||000001||Neal||08-22-2001||01:30 PM||||Currently in my 3rd, well about to start my 3rd year of physical geography.  Great program.<P>Geography is great, much more than the study of maps... my program is more focused on the earths systems.  Soil, water, air, solar systems, and many more.  There is also the political aspect of it as well, think of it as human interaction with the world (eachother, resources, basicly interaction on all levals) <P>When im done i hope to get a job with an oil company doing environmental research.||||reg||1
