Z||000004||MinnGreenGT||08-22-2001||01:38 PM||||Started out as a Computer Engineering (EE) Major at the University of Minnesota-TC.  Decided that I didn't really want to know that much about computers. Shortly thereafter I transferred to a small private tech college (now called <A HREF="http://www.academycollege.com" TARGET=_blank>Academy College</A>) where I studied Multimedia & Graphic Design and dabbled a little in 3D modeling & animation.  As for now, I am currently the IT & Graphics person for <A HREF="http://www.xtralite.com" TARGET=_blank>Xtra Lite Display Systems, Inc. </A><P>I also have recently started my own graphics business (<A HREF="http://www.romatekgraphics.com" TARGET=_blank>Romatek Graphics, inc.</A>), which is not fully functional yet- maybe by the end of this week if everything goes as planned!  I keep everyone updated when things do get rolling 'cause I think I have something Fiero people might want!<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/grngtsig3.jpg">      <P>Medium Metallic Green 87 GT<BR>3.1L High Output<BR>4 Spd OD Tranny<BR>Open (read: Loud) Exhaust<BR>and More!<BR>-Rob Bartlett<p>[This message has been edited by MinnGreenGT (edited 08-22-2001).]||||reg||1
